<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japan shares via Big 4.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japan shares via Big 4.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through Japan's &quot;Big Four&quot; securities houses before the start of stock trading on Monday reflected a net selling stance of 0.5 million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors placed six million shares of sell orders against 5.5 million of buys.</p>
</text>
